# Trial by Fire (outlands 12), completed (a GM) with the fork (a GM): the battlefield's entry holds for a completed quest
# (status accepted or more: a status read in its Lua file). Entered, Ifrit_Prime_TBF killed: won; battlefieldWin is set
# only while accepted, so a GM sets it to 544 with 32001 open (canSkipCS 1): finished: the quest's 32001 handler is the
# accepted section's: nothing (no whisper, no title).
lists CloisterOfFlames/FP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfFlames pos=-720.631,-1.4,-597.955 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByFire completed
keyitem TuningForkOfFire
login
trigger FP_Entrance                     # completed, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill IFRIT_PRIME_ASA-21                 # won while completed: 32001 opens (canSkipCS 1), battlefieldWin not set
localvar battlefieldWin 544             # a GM, 32001 open
finish                                  # completed: no 32001 handler: nothing
